PENDING_PAYMENT --> CANCELLED : hold expired or cancelled
AWAITING_VERIFICATION --> CONFIRMED : admin approves transfer
AWAITING_VERIFICATION --> PENDING_PAYMENT : admin rejects transfer (new hold)
